OL,3,GNEWSAClimate action discussed at youth
OL,4,ACOP meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool children are taking part in an
OL,7,Fevent aimed at inspiring climate
OL,8,Faction, to coincide with the COP31
OL,9,Finternational climate conference in
OL,10,FTurkey.
OL,12,FHosted at the Kingston Maurwood campus,
OL,13,Fthe first Dorset-wide Youth COP has
OL,14,Fbrought children from 14 schools
OL,15,Ftogether to discuss issues including
OL,16,Ffuture careers.
OL,18,FMaria Clarke, of Dorset Local Nature
OL,19,FPartnership, said young people should
OL,20,Fbe "given a voice" over dealing with
OL,21,Fclimate change.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
